# Grand Crescendo: "Create X 1/1 green and white Citizen creature tokens. Creatures you control gain indestructible until
# end of turn." Bot1 casts it with X = 3, so exactly three Citizens arrive, each a 1/1 green and white Citizen token, and
# the indestructible the spell grants keeps its Ornithopter alive through Bot2's Infernal Grasp later that same turn -
# though the destroys' caster still loses its 2 life.

